message: "If you use or adapt this book, please cite it as below."
title: "Open LLM — From Nothing to the Frontier of Language Models"
type: book
authors:
  - name: "Open LLM Project"
version: "2.1"
date-released: "2026-11-02"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/saatvik333/open-llm"
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - large language models
  - transformers
  - machine learning
abstract: >-
  An open, zero-prerequisite guide to artificial intelligence and large
  language models, covering mathematical foundations, transformers,
  training, post-training, reasoning, agents, retrieval, multimodality,
  systems, evaluation, safety, governance, and hands-on labs. Second
  edition, technology snapshot 2 November 2026.
